# Phillip Druskenvald travelling with the party, from the wreck of the Ghostlight Express to Wickermoor's Round (story/banter.gd;
# the scenes he shares with Adela are in guest_adela_druskenvald.dialogue). Each plays once, only while he is along.
# Drafted by Gemini (docs/plans/gemini_companions/reply_guests.json), edited (README). Unvoiced until the voice lane reads them.

~ idle_road_money
if guest:phillip_druskenvald and not flag.wm_welcomed
interject guest:phillip_druskenvald: Money, my friends, is for smoothing an ugly night into a pleasant memory.
interject guest:phillip_druskenvald: A house on a hill, a gift no less. I confess I'm too tired to be curious.
endif
-> END
